cff-version: 1.2.0
title: cuda-depth-buffer
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the paper given under
  preferred-citation.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Leonard
    family-names: Freissmuth
    email: leonard.freissmuth@mrl.ethz.ch
    affiliation: ETH Zurich
repository-code: 'https://github.com/ethz-mrl/mapless-esdf'
url: 'https://ethz-mrl.github.io/mapless-esdf'
abstract: >-
  Euclidean signed distance queries evaluated directly on a circular buffer of
  posed depth images on the GPU, without constructing a map. Queries support an
  optimistic distance, which treats unobserved space as free, and a signed
  conservative distance, which treats it as occupied and includes the boundary
  of unknown space.
keywords:
  - esdf
  - cuda
  - robotics
  - collision avoidance
  - micro aerial vehicle
